{"nodes": [{"id": "presentation_features_inventaire", "label": "features.md \u2014 inventaire des ~220 capacit\u00e9s", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "presentation_features_adresses_perimees", "label": "Les fichier:ligne de features.md sont p\u00e9rim\u00e9s", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u00c9crit le 14 septembre, avant le d\u00e9coupage du lot 6 : les capacit\u00e9s d\u00e9crites restent justes, leurs adresses ne le sont plus. Les adresses \u00e0 jour sont dans les fiches fonctionnalite-*."}, {"id": "presentation_features_invitation", "label": "Invitation \u00e0 usage unique (empreinte SHA-256, 7 jours)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Aucun courriel envoy\u00e9, c'est un choix : pas de SMTP, pas de panne muette. Lien inconnu, utilis\u00e9 ou p\u00e9rim\u00e9 donnent le m\u00eame message \u2014 aucune fuite d'information."}, {"id": "presentation_features_jeton_rafraichissement", "label": "Jeton de rafra\u00eechissement d'un an, stock\u00e9 en SHA-256 seulement", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le jeton voyage dans le corps, jamais dans l'URL \u2014 les URL finissent dans les journaux."}, {"id": "presentation_features_limitation_tentatives", "label": "Limitation des tentatives (5 par quart d'heure + compteur global par IP)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le compteur global attrape le balayage multi-comptes ; un compte d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9 est refus\u00e9 avant le calcul de hachage, sans diff\u00e9rence de temps observable."}, {"id": "presentation_features_grocy", "label": "Le frigo Grocy \u2014 lecture en 5 appels s\u00e9quentiels", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le parall\u00e9lisme a \u00e9t\u00e9 mesur\u00e9 et abandonn\u00e9 : 6,25 s \u2192 29 s et saturation des 8 fils. Les champs personnalis\u00e9s sont lus en une fois, 62 appels ramen\u00e9s \u00e0 1."}, {"id": "presentation_features_inventaire_differe", "label": "Le d\u00e9p\u00f4t d'inventaire r\u00e9pond 202 imm\u00e9diatement", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le 14 ao\u00fbt 2026, PHP s'est arr\u00eat\u00e9 \u00e0 30 s au milieu de 40 lignes pendant que Grocy continuait d'appliquer. Une requ\u00eate HTTP a une dur\u00e9e maximale, un inventaire n'en a pas."}, {"id": "presentation_features_skip_locked", "label": "Prise de lot exclusive \u2014 SELECT \u2026 FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reprise exacte : le compteur est incr\u00e9ment\u00e9 apr\u00e8s chaque ligne. Un lot abandonn\u00e9 se d\u00e9tecte par le silence (2 minutes), pas par l'anciennet\u00e9, car poser une quantit\u00e9 absolue est idempotent."}, {"id": "presentation_features_sept_roles", "label": "Sept r\u00f4les de composition et un mod\u00e8le de repas par moment", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Choix d\u00e9terministe : un tri instable ferait croire \u00e0 un bug."}, {"id": "presentation_features_liste_de_courses", "label": "Liste de courses \u2014 la p\u00e9riode r\u00e9solue deux fois", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Une fois brid\u00e9e par le frigo et une fois frigo plein ; la liste est la diff\u00e9rence. Le solveur ne subit pas une p\u00e9nurie, il la contourne : compter les manques du premier calcul r\u00e9pondrait \u00ab rien \u00bb."}, {"id": "presentation_features_jai_cuisine", "label": "\u00ab J'ai cuisin\u00e9 \u00bb \u2014 marquer le plan puis d\u00e9cr\u00e9menter le frigo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le plan est marqu\u00e9 AVANT de toucher au stock : l'ordre inverse laisserait, en cas de panne, un stock baiss\u00e9 pour un plan qui r\u00e9serve encore. La d\u00e9duction se fait en poids pes\u00e9, avant cuisson."}, {"id": "presentation_features_epley", "label": "Epley et ses deux garde-fous (plafond 15 reps, s\u00e9rie d'une reps)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Au-del\u00e0 de 15 r\u00e9p\u00e9titions on mesure l'endurance ; une r\u00e9p\u00e9tition unique est prise telle quelle car Epley y ajouterait 3,3 % invent\u00e9s."}, {"id": "presentation_features_flux_alarme", "label": "Notification de repos sur le flux ALARME", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Android g\u00e8le les minuteurs JavaScript : c'est le syst\u00e8me qui sonne, application ferm\u00e9e. Le flux ALARME fait sonner t\u00e9l\u00e9phone en vibreur et suit le curseur \u00ab alarme \u00bb."}, {"id": "presentation_features_garanties", "label": "Les douze garanties \u00e9prouv\u00e9es par test de propri\u00e9t\u00e9s", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un m\u00e9ta-test exige plus de 100 sc\u00e9narios r\u00e9ussis ET plus de 100 rat\u00e9s : un jeu o\u00f9 tout tombe juste ne teste pas la gestion de l'\u00e9chec."}, {"id": "presentation_features_habitudes_cuisson", "label": "Les cuissons m\u00e9moris\u00e9es et leurs trois \u00e9tats", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u00ab Je n'en mets pas \u00bb n'est pas \u00ab je n'ai pas r\u00e9pondu \u00bb. Deux couches : habitudes en dessous, choix explicites au-dessus ; la derni\u00e8re d\u00e9cision gagne."}, {"id": "presentation_features_batch_cooking", "label": "Batch cooking \u2014 fourn\u00e9es par fa\u00e7on de cuire, bo\u00eetes en cuit", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "On p\u00e8se sec car l'eau absorb\u00e9e varie ; mais la r\u00e9partition en bo\u00eetes s'annonce en cuit, car annoncer le poids sec devant des bo\u00eetes ferait servir trois fois trop."}, {"id": "presentation_features_zones_dombre", "label": "Zones d'ombre et code suspect", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Restent ouverts : Invitation::domaineAccepteDuCourrier() sans appelant, aucun appel \u00e0 OpenFoodFacts alors que Aliment::source en pr\u00e9voit la valeur."}], "edges": [{"source": "presentation_features_inventaire", "target": "presentation_features_adresses_perimees", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "presentation_features_invitation", "target": "presentation_features_jeton_rafraichissement", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "presentation_features_jeton_rafraichissement", "target": "claude_session_jwt", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "presentation_features_limitation_tentatives", "target": "claude_session_jwt", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "presentation_features_inventaire_differe", "target": "claude_inventaire_lot", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "presentation_features_skip_locked", "target": "claude_traiterinventaires", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "presentation_features_inventaire_differe", "target": "claude_corollaire_chaque_chemin_ecriture", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "presentation/features.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "presentation_